From 79453ada6c7790ffb105385d1062ebc72a92e079 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZeromusXYZ <zeromus.xyz@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Aug 2024 07:31:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [Game] Update to equipment change packet code and pet gear
 bonusses (#1079)

* [Game] Simplified Equipment changing packets

- Added a optional Fix argument to the ``/showinventory`` command that can try to fix duplicate item slot entries
- Added missing check for adding attribute bonuses from equipped gear
- Added ``UpdateGearBonuses`` to Mate (pet gear) and Slave spawns (customization parts)
- Added helper struct ``ItemAndLocation`` to it's own file
- Move Mate Equipment Changed packets to the ``MateEquipment`` container's events
- Added ``Success`` argument to ``SCMateEquipmentChangedPacket``
- Added ``ToString`` for ``ItemLocation`` and ``ItemIdAndLocation``

* [Test] Update for ItemContainer
